{"attributes":{"description":"","kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"filter\":[],\"query\":{\"language\":\"kuery\",\"query\":\"\"}}"},"title":"How to read this","uiStateJSON":"{}","version":1,"visState":"{\"aggs\":[],\"params\":{\"fontSize\":12,\"markdown\":\"### Reading this dashboard\\n\\n**Detections** are rule matches inside activity clusters, each mapped to a MITRE ATT&CK technique.\\n\\n**Behavioural overlap** is how much of the observed behaviour a group's public ATT&CK profile\\ncontains, weighted towards techniques few groups use. It is a similarity, **not** the\\nprobability that the group is responsible: many groups share the same techniques.\\n\\nA group is **identified** only where evidence specific to it was found (a tooling artefact or a\\npublished advisory indicator). Open the platform console for the evidence behind every row.\",\"openLinksInNewTab\":false},\"title\":\"How to read this\",\"type\":\"markdown\"}"},"id":"attribution-note","references":[],"type":"visualization"}
